[G] proof target
    Prove the row-slice lemma: for coprime 1<p/q<=43/20,
      rowdef(p,q)=sum_j |7*c_0j-pq| <= 12p.
    The scan also suggests every row is a cyclic shift of row zero, and rows are
    uniform when 7 divides p or q.  With those two facts, HYP-2736 follows by
      defect_sum = 49*rowdef <= 588p.

